  "description": "Choi Jae-Seung has spent years indulging in one-night stands with BDSM partners, always as a willing masochist. But during a model casting, he suddenly comes face-to-face with the very person who awakened that desire in him: his high school senior, Min Ho-Yeon. After 13 years, Ho-Yeon has returned as Eli, a mysterious top model from the U.S. - and he wastes no time forcing his way back into Jae-Seung’s body and life. What begins as unwanted contact spirals into a dangerous reunion where desire, power, and old wounds collide.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
